================================================================================================================
SUMMARY
================================================================================================================
  Question (A), the flagship and clusters, in the record's resolved shell model with FK1's own trigger:
  - Where it converts (FK1's rate): with streams 60%-69% of the flagship's conversions fall outside r_200
    (delta_t0 = 5.31); smooth spherical infall converts only inside it (0% outside) (F1').
  - The own-density cap holds: the cold carrier inside r_F stays below n_t (S_cold/S_cap <= 0.51); what r_F retains is
    mostly daughters of conversions near it (<= 0.985) (F2a).  So the flagship holds at the linear cell's reading
    (S(r_F) <= 0.9974) and fails at FK1's upper bracket (S(r_F) >= 0.912 canonical) (F2b).
  - The band (W2): forest zeta >= 1.42 (plain) / 2.77 (sqrt sigma) against the flagship's zeta <= nan, nan, nan, nan.
  - Clusters at FK1's rate: shifts against the x5 trigger x0.98-1.00 -> L388's pooled
    eps would read 0.37-0.61 against 0.286-0.768 (X1).

